grantiva: OVERVIEW: The Grantiva CLI for iOS and Android developers.  
run: OVERVIEW: Run Maestro flows against a simulator or emulator. No visual regression — reports step pass/fail and captures a screenshot on failure. 
build_build: OVERVIEW: Build the app for a simulator (xcodebuild) or emulator (Gradle).  
record: OVERVIEW: Record a simulator or emulator and extract PNG frames at exact requested timestamps. 
hierarchy: OVERVIEW: Dump the UI hierarchy of a booted simulator or emulator without relaunching the app. 
The command-line tool for [Grantiva](https://grantiva.io) — the all-in-one platform for iOS and Android developers.
